<Layout title="About Raising Noble">
  <section class="phero"><img src="/images/about-hero.webp" alt="A warm family moment"><div class="phero-in"><h1>About us</h1></div></section>
  <section class="wrap sec prose"><p class="kicker">Our story</p><h2>For the conversations that matter.</h2><p>We're a couple in Wollongong who kept running out of good answers. Raising Noble grew from the belief that a thoughtful conversation, started at the right moment, can give a child confidence that lasts.</p><p>We make educational resources for families: clear background, honest questions and something practical to do together afterwards.</p><p>We are not doctors, dietitians or psychologists. Our kits are educational and are not medical or professional advice.</p></section>
